 public static final String[] STORY_TEXT={"","At dusk, Mira found a letter beneath her pillow. Its ink shimmered like stars. She followed the words into a silent garden, where a frightened cloud had forgotten its name. Mira read the letter aloud. The cloud smiled, remembered the rain, and watered every sleeping flower before the morning arrived.","Beyond the garden, Mira discovered a bridge woven from moonlight. Halfway across, the stars vanished, leaving only her little lantern. A voice beneath the bridge asked why she carried such a tiny light. Mira answered that small lights could still show the next step. The voice belonged to a lost giant who feared the dark. Together they crossed slowly, sharing stories about their homes. With every word, another star returned. At the far bank, the giant lifted Mira high enough to hang her lantern in the sky. Its gentle glow guided every traveler safely home, even on the darkest nights."};
